{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bbb6e465-d0a1-835e-ba62-4bce440afd68",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:01:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisol Salazar",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:57:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:57:28-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Lorraine. Yeah, I'm calling about the storm drain at the corner by my house, 378 Mill Street, up on the Hill. The grate's frozen shut and the water's just spreading out across the whole intersection."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:57:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 378 Mill Street. And the grate is frozen over, you said? Is this from a storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:57:49-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's the thing, there's no storm. It's been dry all week. It's just cold, and there's water running down from somewhere, and it hits that drain, freezes, and then it backs up and goes all over the road. Now it's a sheet of ice out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:58:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so a dry-weather problem. Water's coming from somewhere and the drain is iced over and can't take it. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:58:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. And I'll tell you, I talked to the guy next door this morning and he says it happens every big rain. Every single one. So it's not just the ice. That drain doesn't work right, period."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:58:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. So it's been a repeat issue there, according to your neighbor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:58:39-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. So what I want to know is, when did anybody last come by and look at it? Like, does the city clean it out? Because it looks like nobody's touched it in forever. Leaves, dirt, everything piled on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:58:55-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a fair question. I don't have the cleaning history in front of me on this screen. Let me put in a work request for the drain at Mill Street, and I'll ask the crew supervisor to check when it was last serviced. Is it right at the corner of your house, or across the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:59:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on the corner, same side as my house, right where the sidewalk dips. You can't miss it, there's ice all over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:59:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, same side as 378, at the corner where the sidewalk dips. Do you know the cross street, so the crew finds the right one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:59:36-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's the one right at the top of the block, where it flattens out. Honestly, just say it's the corner next to 378 and they'll see it. It's the only one with a lake around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T10:59:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Corner next to 378 Mill Street, grate frozen, water spreading across the intersection, neighbor says it happens every heavy rain. And you want to know the last time it was serviced."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:00:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And I'm not trying to be rude, but this is not the first time somebody's said something about it. I'd like it if somebody actually did something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:00:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I understand. It's a safety thing too with the ice on the road. Can I get a number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:00:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:00:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0195. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:00:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Marisol Salazar. S-A-L-A-Z-A-R."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:00:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Salazar. I'll flag it so it goes out today, since it's icing up the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:00:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Sorry if I sound short, I didn't sleep great. I've got a houseguest staying with me and he is a very loud sleeper. Like, through-the-wall loud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:00:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that'll do it. Well, I hope you get a quieter night tonight. If the water gets worse or the road gets really slick, call us right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:01:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T11:01:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, and stay warm."
    }
  ],
